@startuml patron-context-object
hide empty members

class ConsoleContext <<record>> {
  +colorView: ColorView
  +limitedIntDialog: LimitedIntDialog
  +yesNoDialog: YesNoDialog
  +coordinateView: CoordinateView
}
class ColorView
class LimitedIntDialog
class YesNoDialog
class CoordinateView {
  +CoordinateView(LimitedIntDialog)
}

ConsoleContext o-> ColorView
ConsoleContext o-> LimitedIntDialog
ConsoleContext o-> YesNoDialog
ConsoleContext o-> CoordinateView
CoordinateView o-> LimitedIntDialog : lee fila/columna

class TicTacToeApp {
  {static} +main(String[])
}
TicTacToeApp ..> ConsoleContext : new(...) — una sola vez

class GameFeature
class LoadFeature
class StatisticsFeature
class ReplayFeature
class ProfileFeature
class AchievementsFeature
class MainMenu
class GameMenu

TicTacToeApp ..> GameFeature : new(gameRegistry, consoleContext)
TicTacToeApp ..> LoadFeature : new(gameRegistry, consoleContext)
TicTacToeApp ..> StatisticsFeature : new(statistics, profileRegistry, consoleContext)
TicTacToeApp ..> ReplayFeature : new(gameHistoryRegistry, consoleContext)
TicTacToeApp ..> ProfileFeature : new(profileRegistry, consoleContext)
TicTacToeApp ..> AchievementsFeature : new(achievementTracker, consoleContext)
TicTacToeApp ..> MainMenu : new(features, consoleContext)
MainMenu ..> GameMenu : new(consoleContext)

class ConsoleGameView
class BoardView
class StartView

GameFeature ..> ConsoleGameView : ViewType.CONSOLE.createGameView(consoleContext)
ConsoleGameView ..> BoardView : new(consoleContext)
ConsoleGameView ..> StartView : new(boardView, consoleContext)

note bottom of ConsoleContext
  Context Object — sustituye a 4 Singletons
  (ColorView, LimitedIntDialog, YesNoDialog,
  CoordinateView) que no necesitaban serlo: eran
  stateless, sin lógica de negocio, sin ningún
  escenario previsible de múltiples instancias.
  Refactor de Singleton, 2026-07-10 — ver
  .agents/steering/05-pattern-gates.md
end note

note bottom of CoordinateView
  Depende de LimitedIntDialog para leer fila/
  columna. Antes del refactor esa dependencia
  estaba oculta detrás de LimitedIntDialog
  .instance(); ahora es explícita por constructor
end note

note right of TicTacToeApp
  Raíz de composición — el único lugar del
  proyecto que instancia ConsoleContext.
  Se enhebra hacia abajo por ~30 clases de
  vista de consola (no todas se muestran aquí;
  ver patron-decorator.puml y patron-command.puml
  para dos ramas concretas de esa cadena)
end note
@enduml
